{"lstm__is_known_to_be__effective_at_capturing_long_term_temporal_dependencies": "The phrase \"is known to be\" indicates a well-established characteristic or reputation of the subject. In this context, it highlights the recognized effectiveness of LSTM networks in a specific application or capability."},
{"effective_at_capturing_long_term_temporal_dependencies": "Capturing long-term temporal dependencies refers to the ability of a model to maintain and utilize information over extended sequences of data. This is crucial in time series analysis where understanding the relationship between past and present data points can significantly influence predictions or classifications."},
