{"truenegatives__are__the_number_of_samples_correctly_identified_as_non_aimbotting_behaviour": "The predicate 'are' in this context signifies the relationship between TrueNegatives and the number of samples that have been correctly identified as non-aimbotting behavior. It establishes that TrueNegatives is a measure of the model's accuracy in correctly classifying non-aimbotting instances."},
