{"classification_accuracies": "The classification accuracies refer to the performance metrics obtained from evaluating machine learning models, specifically LSTM and GRU networks, on a given dataset.|Here is another description: Classification accuracies refer to the performance metrics of a classification model, indicating how accurately the model can predict the correct class for given data. In this context, it pertains to the results obtained from using different confidence thresholds on LSTM and GRU networks."},
