{"the_network_size": "The object \"the network size\" refers to the configuration parameter of the LSTM model that determines the complexity of the neural network. Experimenting with this involved adjusting the number of layers or nodes to find a balance between enough complexity to learn detailed patterns and avoiding overfitting."},
