{"noticeable_improvements_in_accuracy_at_the_required_high_confidence_level": "Noticeable improvements in accuracy at the required high confidence level refers to the enhanced performance of the LSTM network in correctly identifying aimbotting activities. This improvement is significant because it meets the critical requirement of high confidence in predictions, which is essential for fair and viable real-world deployment of the aimbot detector."},
