{"cutting_edge_of_technology": "The \"cutting edge of technology\" refers to the most advanced and innovative technologies available at a given time. In the context of the gaming industry, it implies that the industry is often among the first to adopt and integrate the latest technological developments.|Here is another description: The \"cutting edge of technology\" refers to the most advanced and innovative technological developments available at a given time. In the context of the video game industry, this means consistently adopting and integrating the latest technological advancements to enhance gaming experiences, graphics, gameplay mechanics, and overall performance."},
{"gaming_industry__has_cost__proper_game_security": "The phrase \"has cost\" in this context refers to the trade-offs or sacrifices the gaming industry has made in its relentless pursuit of technological advancement. Specifically, it highlights the compromises made in terms of game security to keep up with rapid technological changes and competitive pressures."},
{"proper_game_security": "Proper game security refers to the measures and protocols implemented to protect games from cheating, hacking, and other forms of malicious activities. It is crucial for maintaining the integrity, fairness, and trust within the gaming community, especially in online multiplayer environments where cheating can significantly impact the player experience."},
