{"truepositives__are__the_number_of_samples_correctly_identified_as_aimbotting": "The predicate 'are' signifies the relationship between TruePositives and the number of samples correctly identified as aimbotting. It indicates that TruePositives is a measure that quantifies the effectiveness of the model in correctly identifying aimbotting behavior."},
