{"the_lstm_and_gru_network": "The LSTM (Long Short-Term Memory) and GRU (Gated Recurrent Unit) networks are types of recurrent neural networks designed to capture long-term dependencies in sequential data. They are commonly used in tasks involving time series data, natural language processing, and other sequence-based applications."},
