{"aimbot_detection": "Aimbot detection refers to the process of identifying and preventing the use of aimbots, which are automated programs that assist players in aiming and shooting within video games. In the context of Minecraft, aimbot detection is crucial to maintain fair gameplay and protect the integrity of the game."},
