{"yaw_pitch": "`yaw, pitch` refers to the angular measurements of an entity's orientation in the Minecraft game world. These values are crucial for determining the direction in which an entity, such as a player or mob, is facing."},
{"yaw_pitch__obtainable_via__getbodyyaw_from_the_livingentity_class": "`obtainable via` indicates the method or function through which certain data or features can be accessed or derived. In this context, it specifies how the `yaw, pitch` values are retrieved from the game's API."},
