{"delta_yaw_delta_pitch": "Delta_yaw and delta_pitch are angular measurements representing the change in orientation of an entity in the yaw (horizontal) and pitch (vertical) axes, respectively. These values are crucial for detecting aimbot usage in Minecraft as they help in analyzing the player's aiming behavior."},
{"delta_yaw_delta_pitch__obtainable_via__getpitch_from_the_entity_class": "Obtainable via refers to the method or function through which specific data or features can be acquired from a class within the Minecraft server software. In this context, it indicates how the necessary player information for aimbot detection can be extracted using the plugin API."},
{"getpitch_from_the_entity_class": "GetPitch is a function from the Entity class in Minecraft's server software, which is used to retrieve the pitch angle of an entity. This function is inherited by the Player class, allowing for the extraction of pitch data essential for aimbot detection algorithms."},
{"position_x_position_y_position_z": "The subject `position_x, position_y, position_z` refers to the three-dimensional coordinates of an entity within the Minecraft game environment. These coordinates are essential for determining the exact location of an entity in the game world."},
