{"functions_from_the_livingentity_and_entity_classes": "The functions from the `LivingEntity` and `Entity` classes are part of the Minecraft server's plugin API. These classes provide methods like `getBodyYaw` and `getPitch`, which are essential for obtaining the `yaw` and `pitch` information needed to calculate `accel_yaw` and `accel_pitch`. These classes are parents to the `Player` class, meaning their methods are inherited by player objects."},
